-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4b128d0b\" data-id=\"4b128d0b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78358589 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"78358589\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Untitled-1500-x-1200-px-r5x98ep6hdpn70b9z72mxc469wqr97kjhlehv411o8.jpg\" title=\"Untitled (1500 x 1200 px)\" alt=\"Untitled (1500 x 1200 px)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52fdf62c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"52fdf62c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mr. Kang Leng\u200b<\/h6>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-354a7361 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"354a7361\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Member<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-61e4b340\" data-id=\"61e4b340\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19341957 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"19341957\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><b>Mr Kang Leng<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin: 0in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0in;\"><b>CEO, ISI GROUP<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin: 0in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in .45pt -.25pt;\">Cambodian born Kang Leng, CEO of ISI GROUP, spent a decade gaining international exposure, experience and education in Singapore and Australia. Leng first studied Bachelor of Commerce (Accounting and Marketing) and went on to complete a Master of Commerce (in Organizational Management) both at the University of New South Wales. Afterwards he worked as a Capital Gain Tax Accountant in States Street, Sydney, for two years.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in .45pt -.25pt;\"><br \/>Returned to Cambodia in 2009 with a passion for entrepreneurship that creates positive impacts and contributions to society, Leng first joined ISI GROUP as an assistant to the Founder. He became Managing Director of ISI STEEL, the founding company of ISI GROUP, in 2011 after having successfully transformed various functions such as the Operations, Accounting &amp; Finance, Procurement, Sales and Marketing. He then became CEO of ISI GROUP in 2017, where he sits today.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in .45pt -.25pt;\"><br \/>Under Leng\u2019s leadership, ISI GROUP has transformed from a small, family-run business into a successful and respectable mid-size corporation with clear vision, core values, good corporate governance and organizational structure. Leng has led ISI GROUP into a number of related diversifications such building material distribution, pre-engineering steel building solution, property development as well as investment into technology start-ups and Cambodia\u2019s iconic F&amp;B brand, Brown Coffee and Bakery to capture the opportunities in the growing economy of Cambodia. He is dedicated to creating positive changes through the work of ISI GROUP and related CSR programs through KMH Foundation. In recognition of Leng\u2019s contribution, he was awarded Distinguished Private Entrepreneurship Award in 2021 by YEAC, and Outstanding Donor Support in Education Award in 2022 by EdTech Asia.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-36a08389 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"36a08389\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6e93bc65\" data-id=\"6e93bc65\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7ae78c elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"a7ae78c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>CamTech Board Members \u00bb Biography \u00ab Go back to The Board of Trustees page Mr. Kang Leng\u200b Member Mr Kang Leng CEO, ISI GROUP \u00a0 Cambodian born Kang Leng, CEO of ISI GROUP, spent a decade gaining international exposure, experience and education in Singapore and Australia. Leng first studied Bachelor of Commerce (Accounting and Marketing) and went on to complete a Master of Commerce (in Organizational Management) both at the University of New South Wales. Afterwards he worked as a Capital Gain Tax Accountant in States Street, Sydney, for two years. Returned to Cambodia in 2009 with a passion for entrepreneurship that creates positive impacts and contributions to society, Leng first joined ISI GROUP as an assistant to the Founder. He became Managing Director of ISI STEEL, the founding company of ISI GROUP, in 2011 after having successfully transformed various functions such as the Operations, Accounting &amp; Finance, Procurement, Sales and Marketing. He then became CEO of ISI GROUP in 2017, where he sits today. Under Leng\u2019s leadership, ISI GROUP has transformed from a small, family-run business into a successful and respectable mid-size corporation with clear vision, core values, good corporate governance and organizational structure. Leng has led ISI GROUP into a number of related diversifications such building material distribution, pre-engineering steel building solution, property development as well as investment into technology start-ups and Cambodia\u2019s iconic F&amp;B brand, Brown Coffee and Bakery to capture the opportunities in the growing economy of Cambodia. He is dedicated to creating positive changes through the work of ISI GROUP and related CSR programs through KMH Foundation. In recognition of Leng\u2019s contribution, he was awarded Distinguished Private Entrepreneurship Award in 2021 by YEAC, and Outstanding Donor Support in Education Award in 2022 by EdTech Asia.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-24234","page","type-page","status-publish